e_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance."}],"target_ref":"sha256:7c4897fe08cf5a20810c6c092d482eedfcb3386523182c99f6fe7d7116f7642d/papers/long.json","target_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the smooth-density part through a continuous quotient and simultaneous polynomial-moment bootstrap. Strict positivity is the separate density-positive passage; full support alone does not establish either conclusion."}],"to":"sha256:4c6350e9b4de8b6fa8cb1160f0ada57e4a2b797aebd0c518c88b1ace1b27878b/papers/long.md/sha256:7c4897fe08cf5a20810c6c092d482eedfcb3386523182c99f6fe7d7116f7642d/papers/long.json/passages/density"},{"annotation_basis":"shared_claim_ids","derived":true,"from":"sha256:05cbf4e9e741677b5970bc48b072a73f79cf221f90eef2e2fc343648710979f7/papers/short.md/sha256:cd663048e396a7d2bc5373694558416e98f52a793166391ec06e3bb5178bc5df/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","id":"shared-claims:4fa5c3059839b1615bcbb381e8caab1e3ba84152826bd47ba33698e0d77c8c4c","kind":"shared_claim","selection_relation":"outgoing","shared_claim_refs":["sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"source_field":"passages.claim_ids","source_ref":"sha256:cd663048e396a7d2bc5373694558416e98f52a793166391ec06e3bb5178bc5df/papers/short.json","source_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92